WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
This is the legitimate son of the sword master prince of Jiandao

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,840
Young Master Xiaosong came back from studying abroad in the Federation.

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,560
We can't win even if we work together for three days.

4
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:08,760
Young master missed a little plan

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,760
It will cause them to be in chaos

6
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,080
My father once said

7
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,200
Know yourself and your enemy and you won’t wait for a hundred battles.

8
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,680
Don't be tough when facing the Xia people

9
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,360
We couldn't attack for three days.

10
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:19,880
Not your problem

11
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,960
But using the wrong method

12
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:25,000
Killing does not bring fear to the people of Xia

13
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,890
On the contrary, it will arouse the madness in their bones.

14
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:30,290
Xia people have fighting genes in their bodies

15
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,970
Claiming to love peace

16
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:35,490
But the Zhou Biao countries were suppressed by them for thousands of years.

17
00:00:35,490 --> 00:00:39,230
They are the most terrifying fighting race in the world

18
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:41,870
So don't think about fighting with the Xia people.

19
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:43,590
Having been the overlord for thousands of years

20
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:46,420
That pride is ingrained in my bones

21
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:47,980
They are not afraid of death

22
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,740
even sometimes
